    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d778">

                <pb facs="1011" n="915" xml:id="pg915"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to Mr. Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-09-28"><hi rendition="#italic">September 28,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The order will be issued. General Greene has just arrived, and have had long talk
                    with him. He is thoroughly well informed. If you care to have him, will direct
                    him to report to you.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William McKinley.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
